# Archon of Emeria: "Nonbasic lands your opponents control enter tapped" (CR 614.1d) and "Each player can't cast more
# than one spell each turn" (CR 101.2). Bot2 casts the Archon on turn 2 with Black Lotus. On turn 3 Bot1's Strip Mine,
# a nonbasic land, enters tapped, and after one spell - Dark Ritual - Bot1 may not cast Duress with the mana still in
# the pool. On turn 4 Bot2's own Strip Mine enters untapped: the Archon taxes only its controller's opponents.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Strip Mine
Dark Ritual
Duress
Swamp x3
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Archon of Emeria
Strip Mine
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Archon of Emeria.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Archon of Emeria
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}{B}
! Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Strip Mine.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
